        ["Where does 'the course told us one real link was planted' come from?", "From the starter notebook's introduction: 'The generator also planted one genuine relationship between ESG scores and returns; whether you find it, and only it, is task (c).' We found exactly one cell, but we cannot prove that our cell is the planted one; with real data nobody gives you that hint."],
