        ["Your rules beat the benchmark. Why do you say there is no edge?", "The Sharpe difference of the best rule is +0.11, but its 95% bootstrap range is -0.16 to +0.38, so it includes zero. And 11% to 19% of random portfolios of the same size do at least as well."],
